        "Crimston, C. R., Hornsey, M. J., Bain, P. G., & Bastian, B. (2018). Moral expansiveness short form: Validity and reliability of the MESx. PLoS ONE, 13(10), e0205373. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0205373",
        "Crimston, D., Bain, P. G., Hornsey, M. J., & Bastian, B. (2016). Moral expansiveness: Examining variability in the capacity to include others in the moral circle. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 111(4), 636–653. https://doi.org/10.1037/pspp0000086",
        "Scoring: Inner Circle = 3, Outer Circle = 2, Fringes = 1, Outside = 0. Total range 0–30."
